WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes is a duration.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Zen12 offers short audio sessions in four styles.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The seller also promises much bigger effects.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Independent evidence for binaural-beat entrainment is mixed.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
That research did not test Zen12's hour-equivalence claim.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Compare the offer, inspect the evidence, and choose freely.
